  "meta": {
    "about": "SolidCraft → PhotoCraft → FigCraft. SolidCraft models the 16 mm die (cube ∩ sphere, 21 pips) in plum and renders it; PhotoCraft gives the render a studio touch-up; FigCraft lays it out as a crowdfunding ad (PNG and PDF). The STL and the measured volume and mass come from the same model, so the ad, the print file and the numbers can't disagree.",
